@startuml
title GameEvents Health Check
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

rectangle "OnPlayerHealthChanged\n6→0" as OnPlayerHealthChanged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnPlayerDeath\n2→3" as OnPlayerDeath #90EE90
rectangle "OnPlayerRevive\n1→1" as OnPlayerRevive #90EE90
rectangle "OnPlayerStaminaChanged\n0→0" as OnPlayerStaminaChanged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnEnemyKilled\n1→1" as OnEnemyKilled #90EE90
rectangle "OnEnemyDamaged\n1→0" as OnEnemyDamaged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnWeaponFired\n1→0" as OnWeaponFired #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnScoreChanged\n2→0" as OnScoreChanged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnHighScoreChanged\n1→0" as OnHighScoreChanged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnGameStarted\n1→1" as OnGameStarted #90EE90
rectangle "OnGamePaused\n0→3" as OnGamePaused #FFE4B5
rectangle "OnGameResumed\n0→2" as OnGameResumed #FFE4B5
rectangle "OnGameOver\n0→3" as OnGameOver #FFE4B5
rectangle "OnLevelComplete\n0→0" as OnLevelComplete #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnEnemySpawned\n3→1" as OnEnemySpawned #90EE90
rectangle "OnEnemyDestroyed\n1→1" as OnEnemyDestroyed #90EE90
rectangle "OnEnemyCountChanged\n4→0" as OnEnemyCountChanged #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnAmmoPickup\n0→0" as OnAmmoPickup #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnHealthPickup\n0→0" as OnHealthPickup #FFB6C1
rectangle "OnNetworkEvent\n0→0" as OnNetworkEvent #FFB6C1

note top
Legend:
Green = Healthy (has publishers & subscribers)
Red = Dead (no subscribers)
Orange = Unused (never fired)
Blue = Potential bottleneck (1 subscriber, many publishers)
end note

@enduml